 "title": "Clean Space Data Yourself",
 "cat": "space",
 "emoji": "🔭",
 "sentences": [
  "Your phone can help NASA fix space telescope data.",
  "Space telescopes like Euclid capture light from millions of distant galaxies.",
  "Sometimes, camera glitches create fake signals called artifacts that confuse AI.",
  "Artifact InSPECtor lets you train AI to spot these errors.",
  "By verifying the data, you help scientists unlock mysteries about dark energy.",
  "Anyone with a laptop or smartphone can join the mission today."
